WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.064 --> 00:00:05.777
"This is all a dream," Jane says.

2
00:00:05.778 --> 00:00:09.675
"Sweet Land is not real."

3
00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:14.972
"You're not fun, Jane," Pip says.

4
00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:21.230
June looks sad. "I must go back now.

5
00:00:21.231 --> 00:00:23.811
I need to meet with the queen.

6
00:00:23.812 --> 00:00:28.789
I will tell her you will not help."

7
00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:32.709
June lands on a cake on the map.

8
00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:47.067
She waves her wand. Zap!

9
00:00:47.068 --> 00:00:53.403
"Where did she go?" Pip asks.

10
00:00:53.404 --> 00:01:02.101
Just then Gran says, "It's time to eat!"

11
00:01:02.102 --> 00:01:16.724
Gran and the kids eat a meal.

12
00:01:16.725 --> 00:01:20.966
"Sweet Land is fun," Pip says.

13
00:01:20.967 --> 00:01:25.076
"We met a sprite who needs our help."

14
00:01:25.077 --> 00:01:28.340
"Oh?" Gran says.

15
00:01:28.341 --> 00:01:32.208
"It's just a game, Pip," Jane says.

16
00:01:32.209 --> 00:01:39.826
"It's real!" Pip says.

17
00:01:39.827 --> 00:01:50.944
Gran pats Jane on the knee. "Be nice."

18
00:01:50.945 --> 00:01:57.192
"Pip," Gran says. "Jane ate her peas.

19
00:01:57.193 --> 00:02:01.082
You ate only meat."

20
00:02:01.083 --> 00:02:09.389
"Green peas." Pip makes a face. "Yuck!"

21
00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:17.792
"If you eat them . . . ," Gran says.

22
00:02:17.793 --> 00:02:28.829
"I will give you a sweet treat."

23
00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:34.371
Jane blinks when she sees Gran's cake.

24
00:02:34.372 --> 00:02:40.922
"It looks like the cake from the game."

